declaration the_date_the_shekel_floors_take_effect content date
  equals |2023-09-01|

declaration the_section_39_rate_for content decimal
  depends on the_role content ARoleCarryingASupplement, the_stage content AStageOfEducation, the_classes_in_the_grade content decimal
  equals (match the_role with pattern -- HomeroomTeacherOfAClassOtherThanTheFirstGrade : 0.1 -- HomeroomTeacherOfAFirstGradeClass : 0.115 -- SubjectCoordinator : (match the_stage with pattern -- APrimarySchool : 0.06 -- AJuniorHighSchool : 0.08) -- RoadSafetyCoordinator : 0.06 -- SecurityCoordinator : 0.06 -- SocialEducationCoordinator : (match the_stage with pattern -- APrimarySchool : 0.06 -- AJuniorHighSchool : 0.1) -- GradeLevelCoordinator : (if (the_classes_in_the_grade <= 4.0) then 0.07 else 0.06) -- LaboratoryCoordinator : 0.03 -- AssessmentAndMeasurementCoordinator : 0.06)

declaration the_shekel_floor_under content decimal
  depends on the_role content ARoleCarryingASupplement
  equals (match the_role with pattern -- HomeroomTeacherOfAClassOtherThanTheFirstGrade : the_floor_under_the_homeroom_supplement -- HomeroomTeacherOfAFirstGradeClass : the_floor_under_the_homeroom_supplement -- GradeLevelCoordinator : the_floor_under_the_grade_coordinator_supplement -- anything : 0.0)

declaration the_floor_under_the_homeroom_supplement content decimal
  equals 1000.0

declaration the_floor_under_the_grade_coordinator_supplement content decimal
  equals 1100.0
```

## Ofek Hadash — the pay computation, in one module

### The month

#### `the monthly pay of`

Compute the monthly pay of an Israeli teacher employed on Ofek Hadash terms — the combined salary from the 2022 table, Tosefet Ofek 2022, the doctorate and role supplements and the school-role supplement, net of the 2025-2026 wage reduction

```catala
scope TheMonthlyPayOf:
  definition the_monthly_pay_of
    equals
      (((the_monthly_pay_before_the_reduction_for of the_teacher, the_date) - ((the_monthly_pay_before_the_reduction_for of the_teacher, the_date) * (the_reduction_rate_on of the_date))) - (the_section_16_withholding_on of the_value_of_any_seniority_step_taken_in_september_2025, the_date))
```
